# Platform: mobilesite
# Story: GJDT-22417 — the product image seen on the PDP is found on the seller catalogue Photos tab
#   (matched by its image file id, so new photos changing the order don't break it) and carries the 360° icon there; the single-image gallery shows NO icon (story: 'Not to be done'); Back keeps the icon.
# Live data: Eden Enterprises, Chennai (only live listing with 360° photos found on 03-Oct-2026; Office Chair / Tyre / CCTV sellers scanned had none).
# Tags: b2b, pdp, catalogue, 360, GJDT-22417
open https://www.justdial.com/jdmart/Chennai/All-Geared-Auto-Feed-Radial-Drilling-Machine-Green-And-Silver-/pid-2233271257/044PXX44-XX44-250214122451-W9P8
wait until element pdp_main_image is visible
store attribute src of pdp_main_image as img_src
store regex "-([a-z0-9]{6,10})\.(?:png|jpe?g|webp)" from img_src as img_id
store attribute href of pdp_seller_catalogue_link as catalogue_url
open https://www.justdial.com${catalogue_url}
wait until url contains "_BZDET"
wait 3 seconds
click pdp_tab_photos
wait until element pdp_photo_tile is visible
# find the SAME image on the catalogue Photos tab (by file id, not by position)
scroll to catalogue_photo_tile_matching
verify element catalogue_photo_tile_matching is visible
verify element catalogue_photo_tile_matching_360_icon is visible
verify element catalogue_photo_tile_matching_360_icon is inside catalogue_photo_tile_matching_image
take screenshot as matched_image_photos_tab
# single-image gallery: 360 icon must NOT show (GJDT-22417: "single images on the Gallery Page (Not to be done)")
click catalogue_photo_tile_matching_image
wait until element gallery_slide_image is visible
wait 2 seconds
verify element gallery_360_icon is not visible
take screenshot as matched_image_gallery_no_icon
# back on the Photos tab: the same image still carries the 360 icon
go back
wait until element pdp_photo_tile is visible
scroll to catalogue_photo_tile_matching
verify element catalogue_photo_tile_matching_360_icon is visible
